1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,200
Hi everyone, I’m Saurabh. Code reviews are one of the biggest bottlenecks in modern engineering teams.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:13,800
Senior developers spend countless hours reviewing pull requests, while critical bugs, security vulnerabilities, and anti-patterns still slip through to production.

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:19,600
To solve this, I built CodeSentinel — an automated, 24/7 intelligent code reviewer powered by Google Cloud.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,500
The moment a developer opens a pull request, GitHub webhooks trigger our serverless Cloud Run backend.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,500
It fetches the diff, injects historical context from Google Cloud Firestore, and calls Gemini 1.5 Pro on Vertex AI to perform deep, multi-language code analysis.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,800
Unlike basic linters or chat interfaces, CodeSentinel provides an objective 100-point quality score across Correctness, Security, Performance, and Style.

7
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:50,000
Even better, it possesses historical learning: it stores every review in Firestore, learning team patterns so future reviews get progressively smarter.

8
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:54,800
[Ambient Music Playing] CodeSentinel 24/7 Live Monitoring & Aggregate Statistics Dashboard.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:08,000
[Architecture Flow] GitHub PR Webhook -> Google Cloud Run -> Vertex AI Gemini 1.5 Pro -> Cloud Firestore -> Automated PR Review Comments.

10
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:23,000
[Live Review Inspection] Pull Request #42 scored 88/100 (Grade A) with multi-dimensional category benchmarks and critical security alerts.

11
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:36,000
[Automated Vulnerability Detection] Flagging SQL parameter interpolation risk on Line 65 with inline remediation suggestions.

12
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:48,000
[Multi-Language Support] Native code reviews across Python, Go, and TypeScript with Firestore historical learning memory.

13
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:51,600
[Open Source Repository] GitHub: https://github.com/saurabhhhcodes/code-sentinel. Built for Code Kitchen Season 01.
